## 3. Side-by-Side Comparison

### 3.1 Feature Engineering

| Component | Baseline (Human) | AI Pipeline |
|-----------|-----------------|-------------|
| Feature source | Auto-inferred from dtypes | Explicit domain-engineered features |
| Derived features | None | LOS, age, prior visits, days since last admit |
| Temporal features | None | Admission month, day-of-week, time since last admit |
| Interaction terms | None | `age × chronic_flag` |
| Target transformation | None | `log1p(cost)` for regression |
| Clinical scores | None | Vitals stability flag, pending orders flag |
| ICD coding | Raw string | ICD chapter grouping |

### 3.2 Model Selection

| Task | Baseline | AI Suggestion | Reason |
|------|----------|---------------|--------|
| Readmission | `RandomForestClassifier` (100 trees) | `XGBClassifier` (500 trees + `scale_pos_weight`) | Better with imbalanced labels; sequential boosting corrects minority class errors |
| ED Cost | `RandomForestRegressor` (100 trees) | `LGBMRegressor` + log1p target + quantile regressor | Handles skewed cost distributions; early stopping prevents overfitting; prediction intervals for uncertainty |
| Discharge | `RandomForestClassifier` (100 trees) | `LGBMClassifier` + `CalibratedClassifierCV` | Calibrated probabilities required for time-sensitive clinical decisions |

### 3.3 Training Procedure

| Step | Baseline | AI Pipeline |
|------|----------|-------------|
| Validation | 80/20 holdout only | 5-Fold Stratified CV (classification) / KFold (regression) |
| Stratification | ❌ Not used | ✅ `StratifiedKFold` for classification |
| Imbalance handling | ❌ None | ✅ `SMOTE` + `scale_pos_weight` / `class_weight='balanced'` |
| Hyperparameters | Fixed defaults | Tuned via `Optuna` or `GridSearchCV` with CV |
| Early stopping | ❌ None | ✅ Used in LightGBM/XGBoost |
| Feature selection | ❌ None | ✅ SHAP-based importance → drop near-zero importance features |

### 3.4 Evaluation

| Metric | Baseline | AI Pipeline |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| Classification | `macro_f1`, `weighted_f1` | + `AUC-ROC`, `AUPRC`, `Brier Score`, threshold analysis |
| Regression | `MAE`, `RMSE`, `R²` | + `SMAPE`, `Median AE`, prediction intervals (q10/q90) |
| Cross-validation | ❌ Not used | ✅ CV mean ± std for all metrics |
| Feature importance | ❌ Not saved | ✅ SHAP values (global + local) |

