|--------|-----------------|---------------------|---|
| AUC-ROC | ~0.68–0.72 | ~0.76–0.82 | **+6–10pp** |
| AUPRC | ~0.20–0.30 | ~0.35–0.50 | **+15–20pp** |
| Macro F1 | ~0.55–0.62 | ~0.65–0.72 | **+7–10pp** |
| Minority class Recall | ~0.35–0.45 | ~0.58–0.70 | **+15–25pp** |

*Primary gains from: SMOTE, `scale_pos_weight`, stratified CV, domain features (prior admissions, LOS, time-since-last-admit)*

